!!! archon/model/confidence.mat
!!! How certain an analyzer is that a finding is real.
!!!
!!! Confidence is separate from severity so a scan can rank by risk while still
!!! disclosing how much of that risk is a guess. Pattern matches are usually
!!! Speculative or Low; a parser-backed analysis can be Likely or Certain.

book archon.model.confidence

read everything from ny.lang.core

public confidence begin choice
    when Speculative
    when Low
    when Moderate
    when Likely
    when Certain
end choice

!!! Ordinal rank; higher means more certain.
public confidence-rank receives certainty as confidence returns number begin paragraph
    value rank as number is consider certainty
        when confidence.Speculative give 0
        when confidence.Low give 1
        when confidence.Moderate give 2
        when confidence.Likely give 3
        when confidence.Certain give 4
        otherwise give 0
    end consider
    give rank
end paragraph

!!! A stable, lower-case name for machine-readable output.
public confidence-name receives certainty as confidence returns text begin paragraph
    value name as text is consider certainty
        when confidence.Speculative give "speculative"
        when confidence.Low give "low"
        when confidence.Moderate give "moderate"
        when confidence.Likely give "likely"
        when confidence.Certain give "certain"
        otherwise give "speculative"
    end consider
    give name
end paragraph
